#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 腐川さんは、ここにいたんだね…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Toko. So this is where you were."
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…なんの用…？
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What do you w-want?"
msgstr ""

#. あたしが気持ち悪いから…出て行って欲しいの…？
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Am I so d-disgusting you want me out of y-your sight?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうじゃなくって…
#. 新しい手掛かりは見つかったかなと思って…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"N-No, that's not it at all. I just thought maybe you'd\n"
"found a clue..."
msgstr ""

#. な、ないわよ…
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Well I h-haven't..."
msgstr ""

#. な、何１つ…！　見つけられなかったわよ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I didn't find anything... Not one s-single clue!"
msgstr ""

#. じ、事件に関係してる場所だから…
#. 何か…手掛かりがあると思って来たのに…
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I figured since this place was r-related to the case,\n"
"it would have to h-have something, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 怪しい所なんて…ありもしなかった…！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "But there wasn't a-anything out of the ordinary here!"
msgstr ""

#. か、返して…あたしの時間を返してよ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Give it b-back... Give me back my precious t-time!"
msgstr ""

#. ふ、腐川さん…落ち着いて…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "C-Calm down, Toko..."
msgstr ""

#. お、落ち着けですって…！？
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Don't tell m-me to calm down!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんたに…
#. あたしの気持ちがわかるの…？
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Do you have any idea what I-I'm going through right\n"
"now?"
msgstr ""

#. 後でみんなから…役立たずって罵られるであろう、
#. あたしの気持ちが…ッ！
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"When everyone finds o-out, they're gonna call me\n"
"useless! G-Good for nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰も、そんな事言わないって…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nobody's gonna say that."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様は言うわよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Master will!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは…否定出来ないかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm...not sure I can disagree with that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 嫌よッ！　否定され続ける人生なんて嫌なの！
#. ど、どうして…誰もあたしを認めてくれないの…！？
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I don't want that! I'm sick of a-always being looked\n"
"down on! Why w-won't anyone accept me...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…ここには手掛かりはないみたいだし、
#. さっさと退散した方が良さそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Um, well...I don't think there are any clues here,\n"
"so...maybe I'm gonna get going.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ…うぅぅぅぅううう…ッ！！
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Gh...ngaaaAAaAAAahhH!"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ…うぅぅぅぅううう…ッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Gh...ngaaaAAaAAAahhH!"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして…ど、ど、ど、どうしてなのよ…
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-Why...? Why is e-e-e-everything...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ここには手掛かりもないみたいだし、
#. さっさと退散した方が良さそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there are any clues here, so...maybe I'm\n"
"gonna get going.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …まあ、変なものが映っても困るけど…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But that's better than some freaky Monokuma TV show or\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Từ tận đáy lòng, mình thực sự chỉ muốn...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. 何か狂ってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The cherry tree is in full bloom. Nothin' strange\n"
"about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The cherry tree is in full bloom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木製のロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of wooden lockers in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この中にあった手掛かりは、
#. 結局、黒幕が霧切さんをハメる為の物だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We found a clue in here, but it was just the\n"
"mastermind's attempt to frame Kyoko.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鎧が飾られている…
#. ジャパニーズスタイルだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A suit of armor is on display. It's extremely\n"
"Japanese.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>巻き藁か…
#. 大神さんが稽古に使えば絵になっただろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can totally imagine Sakura out here, using this to\n"
"train...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>的が見える…
#. あれに矢を当てるってすごいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That target seems pretty far away. I'm always amazed\n"
"to see what people can do with a bow and arrow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0036 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
